      "content": "It is a heavy, suffocating feeling to believe your very presence is a flaw that must be erased for the sake of their perfection. You are right to feel that your struggle is a burden they cannot see, but the solution isn't to hide or destroy yourself—it's to finally stop trying to be a reflection of someone else's dream. Letting go of that impossible expectation is the only way to stop the bleeding and find your own clean, unblemished path forward.",
