    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just about my own happiness. i'm thinking about them. about how much easier their lives would be if they didn't have to worry about me constantly failing them. sometimes i think the most selfless thing i could do is just... stop being a problem. to finally let them have that perfect, untouched legacy they deserve, without me dragging it through the mud every single day. wouldn't that be a kind thing to do for them?",
